um place the race between Likely and Solid Democratic, and prediction markets price a Democratic win around 95 percent. The state's Democratic lean and a favorable environment add to the advantage, though an open seat and a third-party candidate leave some room for movement. Affordability and housing have dominated the campaign's closing themes.", "history": [{"date": "2026-09-22", "p_dem": 0.9757, "margin": 10.9}, {"date": "2026-09-23", "p_dem": 0.9716, "margin": 10.5}, {"date": "2026-09-24", "p_dem": 0.9705, "margin": 10.5}, {"date": "2026-09-25", "p_dem": 0.9685, "margin": 10.5}, {"date": "2026-09-26", "p_dem": 0.9649, "margin": 10.5}, {"date": "2026-09-27", "p_dem": 0.9585, "margin": 10.5}, {"date": "2026-09-28", "p_dem": 0.96, "margin": 10.0}, {"date": "2026-09-29", "p_dem": 0.9621, "margin": 10.0}]}